[2] S. Rajwar and J. R. Goodman, *Speculative Lock Elision: Enabling Highly Concurrent Multithreaded Execution*, HPCA 2001 and *Improving In-Memory DB Index Performance with Intel R TSX*, ISCA 2013 drafts, Available: https://pages.cs.wisc.edu/~rajwar/papers/hpca_TSX.pdf and http://pages.cs.wisc.edu/~rajwar/papers/SC13_TSX.pdf — L1-based tracking, lemming effect mitigation, conflict detection at cache
